{"title":"Two Laws","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/920582423/0/marginalrevolution~Two-Laws.html","date":1750590890000,"content":"<blockquote><p>In Italy, you need a <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.firstmedcenters.it/sportsmedicine#:~:text=Sports%20Medical%20Certificate,pools%20and%20schools%20in%20Italy.\">doctor’s permission</a> before joining a gym or running a marathon.</p>\r\n<p>In Virginia and many other states, you need an <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.allenandallen.com/blog/expired-vehicle-inspection-stickers-and-virginia-law/\">annual auto safety inspection</a> to legally drive.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Which of these laws is the most beneficial/costly? Show your work.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/two-laws.html\">Two Laws</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/920582423/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/920582423/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/920582423/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/920582423/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/920582423/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/920582423/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrev